        },
        {
          "text": "A’disiku Hamani Hamedata mvi ’ba Agagiari, ari’bo Yahudini driari, otu ndra asi inia ’ba Yahudini ma dri jazu, eri ’be ndra Puri, efini odrisini, yi ofuzu dria, yi dri jazu; ",
